WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:17.851
- [gasp]

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.656
ARE YOU MS. TUBMAN?
- THE NAME'S HARRIET.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.558
- WELL, THANK GOD IN HEAVEN

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.394
FOR THE WORK
THAT YOU'RE DOING, HARRIET.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.965
- BEFORE YOU THANK ME,
LET ME TELL YOU.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.534
I'VE LED HUNDREDS OF SLAVES
TO FREEDOM

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:38.905
THROUGH THIS HERE
UNDERGROUND RAILROAD.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:42.442
BUT IT AIN'T GON' BE EASY.
ARE YOU READY?

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.279
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.815
THEN HIKE UP YOUR BREECHES

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:53.686
AND FOLLOW ME TO FREEDOM!

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.088
[screaming]

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:58.091
[adventurous music]

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:05.732
♪ ♪

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.807
WATCH THIS [bleep].

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.390
- WELL, WHERE IS SHE NOW?

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:35.895
- THAT WAS THE EASY PART.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.831
NOW STAY CLOSE.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:41.367
THIS NEXT 500 MILES
GETS A LITTLE STICKY.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.402
AH!

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:48.775
- FORGET THIS, MAN.
I'M GOING BACK.

